node_modules/

# webpack writes everything in public/: the bundle, the extracted CSS, the HTML that
# HtmlWebpackPlugin generates from src/index.html, and the images file-loader copies out
# of src/images. It was tracked, and the committed bundle had drifted from the source
# that produces it (9333 bytes against 9389 for a fresh build of the same commit), so
# the repository shipped a bundle its own source no longer generated. Run a build.
/public/

